BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Continuing Studies] Beyond the Hype: What the Stanford AI Index R
 eveals About AI
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260917T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260917T130000
DTSTAMP:20260917T172952Z
UID:stanford_campus-localist-53737637654201-53737637655226@local-events
DESCRIPTION:AI headlines move fast\, and it's not always easy to tell mean
 ingful progress from hype. The Stanford AI Index Report cuts through the n
 oise with a data-driven view of how AI is actually developing around the w
 orld and what the evidence shows—not just what the narrative claims. Joi
 n Sha Sajadieh of Stanford HAI for an accessible look at this year's key f
 indings from the Index and a clearer framework for evaluating AI claims go
 ing forward.\n\nThis webinar is designed for business and technology prof
 \n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://continuingstudies.stanford.edu/stanfor
 d-ai-index-webinar\nLast synced: 2026-09-17 10:29 PDT
URL:https://continuingstudies.stanford.edu/stanford-ai-index-webinar
END:VEVENT
